  "revised": "2026-10-17",
  "source": "ABB, \"B21 User Manual\", 2CMC485004M0201 revision D (2025-11-07); https://library.abb.com/d/2CMC485004M0201",
  "sources": [{"title": "B21 User Manual", "version": "2CMC485004M0201 revision D", "date": "2025-11-07", "url": "https://library.abb.com/d/2CMC485004M0201"}],
  "notes": [
    "ABB EQ meter B21 (single phase, direct connected, 65 A) with RS485, protocol set to Modbus.",
    "Addresses are exactly as sent on the bus. Readable range is 0x1000-0x8EFF; any block of 1-125 registers works.",
    "The manual lists the common EQ mapping; only the single-phase quantities are in this map. The others read as \"invalid\".",
    "Quantities a model does not have read as \"invalid\": all FFFF for unsigned, the largest positive value for signed.",
    "Outputs, tariffs, resettable registers, CO2 and currency depend on the variant (Steel, Bronze, Silver). Steel meters (B21 1xx-xxx) only have import registers.",
    "The manual does not state the factory RS485 settings; check them on the meter display."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "unit_id": 1,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "max_read_registers": 125,
  "enums": {
    "off_on": {"0": "Off", "1": "On"}
  },
  "sentinels": {
    "uint16": {"0xFFFF": "Invalid"},
    "int16": {"0x7FFF": "Invalid"},
    "uint32": {"0xFFFFFFFF": "Invalid"},
    "int32": {"0x7FFFFFFF": "Invalid"},
    "uint64": {"0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF": "Invalid"},
    "int64": {"0x7FFFFFFFFFFFFFFF": "Invalid"}
  },
